  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "as_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -264
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "ASCII cells\n\nThe Effect node's `ascii` mode redraws a layer as text: the canvas is cut into cells `size` pixels tall, and each cell's brightness picks a character from `chars`, darkest first (a space for black). With `colored` on, each character takes its cell's colour.\n\nThe layer here is reaction–diffusion in its `fingerprints` preset: ridges that spread from a few drops until they fill the canvas. Try your own ramp in `chars`, a bigger `size`, or turn `colored` off for one-colour terminal text.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "ASCII cells\n\nThe Effect node's `ascii` mode redraws a layer as text: the canvas is cut into cells `size` pixels tall, and each cell's brightness picks a character from `chars`, darkest first (a space for black). With `colored` on, each character takes its cell's colour.\n\nThe layer here is reaction–diffusion in its `fingerprints` preset: ridges that spread from a few drops until they fill the canvas. Try your own ramp in `chars`, a bigger `size`, or turn `colored` off for one-colour terminal text.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
